{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54556","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵发（京本作「发兵」）日，天气久阴沉。\n不雨又无光彩色，奸人谋事（京本作「士」）恨怀心，仔细速（京本作「早」）推寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}